tate:** all three regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) describing the failure, the two-step rollback, the current healthy state, and follow-ups. The create call timed out, but I verified via `list_incidents` that it was recorded and did not retry, so the on-call was paged exactly once.\n\n**Suggested follow-ups** (noted in the incident): root-cause v2.3.1 before any redeploy, and investigate the orchestrator error that interrupted the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}